        "validation-key": "mass-concentration-of-violaxanthin-in-sea-water",
        "ui-label": "Mass Concentration Of Violaxanthin In Sea Water",
        "description": "\"Mass concentration\" means mass per unit volume and is used in the construction \"mass_concentration_of_X_in_Y\", where X is a material constituent of Y. A chemical species or biological group denoted by X may be described by a single term such as \"nitrogen\" or a phrase such as \"nox_expressed_as_nitrogen\". The chemical formula of violaxanthin is C40H56O4.",
