        "description": "\"y\" indicates a vector component along the grid y-axis, when this is not true latitude, positive with increasing y. Projection coordinates are distances in the x- and y-directions on a plane onto which the surface of the Earth has been projected according to a map projection. The relationship between the projection coordinates and latitude and longitude is described by the grid_mapping.",
        "canonical_units": "m",
        "cf-name": "projection_y_coordinate",
        "type": [
