        "ui-label": "Right Singular Vector Of Remote Sensing Averaging Kernel Of Logarithm Of Mole Fraction Of Methane In Air",
        "description": "Right singular vectors of the matrix representing the logarithmic scale remote sensing averaging kernels (Weber 2019; Schneider et al., 2022) of the methane mole fractions obtained by a remote sensing observation (changes of methane in the retrieved atmosphere relative to the changes of methane in the true atmosphere, Rodgers 2000; Keppens et al., 2015).",
        "canonical_units": "1",
        "cf-name": "right_singular_vector_of_remote_sensing_averaging_kernel_of_logarithm_of_mole_fraction_of_methane_in_air",
        "type": [
          "wcrp:standard-name",
          "cf"
        ]
      },
